# The PostgreSQL variation point attaches to the proto example of the HTTP
# variation point, the one that keeps its lists in memory: it deletes that store
# and adds src/Infrastructure/Postgres, the migration job src/App/App.Migrate,
# and the command scope in BuildingBlocks. The base files it changes are the
# composition root and its project, the module's service with its registration
# and scenarios (the store's namespace, and the unavailable answer), the module's
# errors, the host's scenarios project, and the solution's build files.
base library/architecture/dotnet/vp-http-api-in-dotnet.skill/examples-proto
change src/App/App.Host/Program.cs
change src/App/App.Host/App.Host.csproj
change src/App/App.Host.Tests/App.Host.Tests.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Todo.Application.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/TodoModule.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Services/ItemListsService.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application.Tests/Steps/ItemListsServiceSteps.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application.Tests/features/ItemListsService.feature
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Domain/Errors/TodoErrors.cs
change Directory.Packages.props
change Todo.slnx
change Makefile
change README.md
delete src/Infrastructure/Memory/*
